sco Talos 分析了自删除型 Windows 信息窃取程序 VOLTA-AUTODOXER：它采集浏览器凭据、会话、支付卡、加密钱包种子、OAuth 令牌、云端密钥、Wi-Fi 密码及截图后，将结构化证据发送至 OpenRouter，由 LLM 生成包含“WHAT THEY'RE WORTH”和“THEIR OPSEC”的受害者评估。","source",{"_56":262,"_263":264},"publishedAt","selected",true,"Cisco Talos","firstParty",false,"iwth0fqx6ia7tenhninnv0fjn","Cisco Talos 发现 VOLTA Windows 信息窃取木马，用 Claude、Gemini 和 Kimi 评估受害者价值","Cisco Talos 发现 Windows 信息窃取木马 VOLTA-AUTODOXER（VOLTA），会收集浏览器密码与 Cookie、支付卡、加密钱包种子短语、Microsoft OAuth tokens、SSH 与云密钥等，并通过 Gmail 收据补充地址等信息。",{"_56":270,"_263":264},"2026-11-02T05:51:07.000Z","The Hacker News","teb8ck1hkyzday4txbjv13ws9","Cisco Talos 分析 AI 驱动窃密木马 VOLTA-AUTODOXER","Cisco Talos 发现 Windows 窃密木马 VOLTA-AUTODOXER，可窃取浏览器密码、Cookie、支付卡、钱包种子、OAuth tokens、SSH 与云密钥、会话及 Wi-Fi 密码，并借助 OpenRouter API 对受害者资产进行变现价值分级。",{"_56":276,"_263":264},"2026-11-02T14:47:57.000Z","Help Net Security","cy90zbdehwxv5memq7aqw725b","Cisco Talos 分析了 Windows 信息窃取器 VOLTA-AUTODOXER。该程序窃取浏览器密码、Cookie、支付卡、加密钱包种子短语、OAuth tokens、SSH 与云凭据等数据，并借助 LLM 生成受害者资产估值、安全习惯评估及可变现信息分级；默认调用 Claude Opus 4.6，失败后切换 Kimi K2 和 Gemini 2.5 Flash。",{"_56":280,"_263":264},"Security Affairs",{"_282":283,"_13":284,"_20":21,"_17":18,"_285":286},"factId","fAFp_Yp6uqsI","披露VOLTA窃密木马AI画像流程","representative",{"_253":254,"_13":255,"_28":256,"_257":287,"_259":21,"_260":261},{"_56":262,"_263":264},"participants48h","newParticipants6h",0,"recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",{"_295":296,"_297":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
